@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #486777
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EEF5FA
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #486777
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam packageBorderColor #486777
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EEF5FA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B59865
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam padding 8
title Dependency network — conditions, not scheduled dates
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Requirements + populated analysis\nExact meaning / remaining questions" as analysis
rectangle "OAuth setup / provider access evidence" as oauth
rectangle "Resource / isolation feasibility" as capacity
rectangle "Backup scope / restore evidence" as recovery
rectangle "Affected design choices\nProtocol / storage / runner / operations" as design
rectangle "Identified package review\nOwner disposition / delivery reconciliation" as review
rectangle "Implementation-ready scope" as ready
analysis --> design : source constraints
oauth --> design : provider-dependent decisions
capacity --> design : execution-dependent decisions
recovery --> design : recoverability-dependent decisions
design --> review : explicit choices and unresolved gates
review --> ready : only accepted ready scope

legend bottom
Edges are conditional prerequisites, not a critical-path estimate, Gantt schedule or new gate for independent work.
endlegend
@enduml
